tinaontaon kapag pistay paskua oonlad jerusalem iray atateng nen jesus
onung na ibabagay masanton sulat say toon anipoy dakel ag alabas ed kinarakel so kayaryan to tan say toon anipoy daiset ag alabas ed kinaraiset so kayaryan to
pinili kayoy dios ama onung ed getma to lan nanlapud gapoy gapo tan pinasanto kayoy ispiritu pian magmaliw kayon maonur ed jesucristo tan nalinisan kayoy dala to nawalaan kayo komuy ag nasabsabaan a bindision tan kareenan
